      en: ["Sironko's population was 18,800 in the 2014 census.", "The town is located at an elevation of 1,150 meters above sea level.", "Sironko District covers an area of 1,091 square kilometers.", "The average annual rainfall is 1,400 mm.", "Coffee is the main cash crop, with annual production of 3,000 tons.", "The nearest major city is Mbale, 25 km south."],
